  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MYWP Catalysing the Green Transition in BIH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201C;Catalysing the Green Transition in Bosnia and Herzegovina&#x201D; is a 5-year programmatic framework, developed by UNDP in Bosnia and Herzegovina, in cooperation with governmental counterparts and international development partners. It leverages new development thinking and aims to catalyse and anchor a broader and just transformation towards a green and zero-carbon Bosnia and Herzegovina. MYWP encompasses four Pillars: Pillar 1: Decarbonisation and Climate Resilience; Pillar 2: Depollution; Pillar 3:</narrative>
  </description>
